== problems
== questions
agg:address (G2E-10): Aggregation Address -> entity
multi:musician:instrument:plays (G2E-5): Multi-valued: Musician plays Instrument -> entity
multi:band:genre:genres (G2E-5): Multi-valued: Band genres Genre -> entity
inv:musician:band (G2E-7): Musician member of / Band members -> merge
